@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……如果真是这样，那我们只要指出这一点，<br>也许就能让她重新考虑计划了！|#0206Trial05_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:真、真的会有这么顺利吗……？|#0206Trial05_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Option_Arms-
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……前提是，<br>如果【吾辈的魔法还能起到些许效果】的话……|#0206Trial05_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:只要能说服她同意我们的意见，<br>或许就能某种程度上左右她的行动。|#0206Trial05_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

