@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:每隔短短几十年，就会发生一次技术革新，<br>而且这些革新甚至能彻底改变人类生活方式。|#0206Trial05_Yuki015| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:只要稍不注意，<br>人类马上就会制造出新的威胁……|#0206Trial05_Yuki016| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:亲眼见证同胞被人类灭绝，令我学会了一件事。|#0206Trial05_Yuki017| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
